Most files under `federatedscope/` come from that project and keep its
copyright and license. The additions and modifications in this repository
are released under the same license. They include:

  * `federatedscope/glue/`: GLUE data loading and DeBERTa model building.
  * `federatedscope/contrib/` and `federatedscope/core/aggregators/`:
    the HetLoRA, FAH-QLoRA and AdaS method implementations, the bandwidth
    manager and the network-trace loader. FedIT runs through the FedAvg
    path of `federatedscope/core/`.
  * Changes to `federatedscope/core/` for heterogeneous LoRA ranks,
    sparse rank-1 component exchange and communication accounting.
  * `configs/` and `scripts/`.

FedIT, HetLoRA and FAH-QLoRA are included as comparison baselines.

